content:
lena: quick note — brought quant-mpt-1.2 (8bit) into staging for func-call evals. seeing a lot of parse failures when streaming + client retries.

ajay: can you paste a raw example?

lena: ```
{ "tool": "search", "args": { "query": "tokenizer bugs", "limit": 3 }
... (truncated)
```
this one got truncated mid-object and the client retried -> duplicate tool exec.

sree: streaming + retries = partial json fragments combined with duplicate attempts. baseline pass rate on structured schema was 62% (quantized). :grimacing:

sara: two quick ideas: (1) add idempotency token to tool-call meta so retries don't re-run tools; (2) pre-parse repair step to stitch fragments before JSON.parse.

lena: for (1) we already have request_id but not attached to function calls. can change server side to inject `call_id`. for (2) i prototyped a tiny repair util:

```
function repairStream(text){
  const start = text.indexOf('{');
  const end = text.lastIndexOf('}');
  if(start>-1 && end>-1 && end>start) return text.slice(start, end+1);
  // fallback: try to close brackets heuristically
  let s = text;
  const open = (s.match(/\{/g)||[]).length;
  const close = (s.match(/\}/g)||[]).length;
  while(close<open){ s += '}'; }
  return s;
}
```

ajay: nice. what's the perf hit? we can't block streaming longer than 20ms normally.

lena: negligible on small outputs; biggest hit is complexity when nested arrays are large. benchmark: after repair + 200ms retry backoff + call_id idempotency, pass rate -> 93% on same eval set. CPU overhead ~3%.

sree: are we sure quantization caused this? control with fp16 model?

lena: yes — fp16 baseline was 97% pass, quantized went down to 62%. hypothesis: quantized model emits slightly different tokenization leading to more odd partial outputs at chunk boundaries.

sara: action items:
- attach `call_id` on function calls (server-side) — PR: github.com/redwood/infra/pull/2712
- add pre-parse repair + unit tests in eval harness — PR: github.com/redwood/eng-ml/pull/712
- tweak default retry backoff to 200ms for streaming structured outputs

ajay: I'll owner the call_id change, assign to infra.

sree: I'll bake repair util into eval harness and run full benchmark across models (fp16, 4-bit, 8-bit).

ci-bot: build passed for PR 2712 :white_check_mark:

lena: thanks team — let's monitor canaries for 48h after rollout. filing small regression alert rule for structured-output pass_rate drop.

sara: :thumbsup:
